# Daily Study PDF Generation Plan

## Goal
Generate a single, comprehensive PDF document every day that contains the full text of prayers, the current Daf Yomi (from the API provided link), and excerpts from Musar sources (Pirkei Avot, Pele Yoetz).

## Proposed Changes
- [MODIFY] [lanzador_estudio.py](file:///C:/Users/Antonio/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/torah_automation/lanzador_estudio.py):
  - Add logic to fetch/scrape text for Pirkei Avot and Pele Yoetz (e.g., from Sefaria or local files).
  - Integrate a PDF generation library (e.g., `fpdf2`).
  - Merge the Daf Yomi PDF (if possible) or include its content/link clearly.
- [NEW] `requirements.txt`: To include `fpdf2` or `reportlab`.
- [NEW] `daily_sources.json`: A local database/JSON with the text of fixed prayers (Mode Ani, Shema, etc.) to include in the PDF.

